<title>USA: US Treasuries end quiet day off Tuesday highs.</title>
<headline>US Treasuries end quiet day off Tuesday highs.</headline>
<text>
<p>*US Treasuries recoup earlier losses, end off Tuesday highs. *Richmond Fed's Broaddus sees tightness in U.S. labor markets. *Broaddus sees economy tilted &quot;little bit&quot; to upside. *U.S. stocks staggger lower; DJIA ends 35 points lower. *Dollar hit by profit-taking before close after sharp gains.</p>
</text>
